The sounds in Media/*.ogg were synthesized for this project with ffmpeg and are
covered by this project's license. Media/Icon.tga is this project's own logo
(docs/images/logo.svg in the repository), also covered by its license.

The voice callouts in Media/Voice/ were rendered for this project with the Piper
text-to-speech engine (tools/generate_voices.py in the repository), trimmed and
loudness-normalized:

- Media/Voice/Bryce/: Piper voice en_US-bryce-medium by Bryce Beattie, released
  into the public domain (https://brycebeattie.com/files/tts/).
- Media/Voice/Isla/: Piper voice en_GB-vctk-medium, speaker p277, trained on the
  CSTR VCTK Corpus by the Centre for Speech Technology Research, University of
  Edinburgh (https://datashare.ed.ac.uk/handle/10283/3443), licensed under
  CC BY 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/).

The cast-target highlight technique (PlayerIsSpellTarget fed to
Region:SetAlphaFromBoolean) follows Blizzard's documented 12.x API and is also
used by sArena Reloaded (https://github.com/Bodify/sArena_Reloaded); no code
from sArena Reloaded is included.
